<title>USA: BankAmerica unit, MCI extend telecom pact.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica unit, MCI extend telecom pact.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>MCI Communications Corp said it said signed a new three-year agreement with BankAmerica Corp's Bank of America unit, designating MCI as its primary long-distance communications provider through 1999.</p>
<p>The multimillion-dollar pact extends and expands an existing four-year agreement signed in 1993.</p>
<p>Under terms of the pact, MCI will continue to provide Bank of America with its virtual private network service.</p>
</text>
